"EN-S1-LS-01.3","T","Grandpa has two dreams.","book",48],["EN-S1-TH-01.19","P","He wants to grow tall rice plants.","book",48]]},{"id":"a9e26e8b-30f2-46b5-7288-57a6ffe73415","title":"Unit 4_Fuel up_1 Listen and chant.","chapters":["Unit 4 Plant life","Fuel up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-TX-01.1"],"align":[["EN-S1-TX-01.1","T","Yummy, yummy food， Comes from plants.","book",49],["EN-S1-LS-01.9","P","Listen and chant.","book",49]]},{"id":"b1af1cf4-028e-1c6d-499d-506be89b5c8c","title":"Unit 4_Fuel up_3 Listen and choose.","chapters":["Unit 4 Plant life","Fuel up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LS-01.16"],"align":[["EN-S1-LS-01.16","T","What comes from plants？","book",50],["EN-S1-LK-01.6","P","Listen and choose.","book",50]]},{"id":"9290deef-7ea5-47c0-712c-e9ad8574681d","title":"Unit 4 Plant life (Hit it big)","chapters":["Unit 4 Plant life","Hit it big"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.11","EN-S1-LS-01.16"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.11","T","Now I can name parts of a plant：","book",53],["EN-S1-LS-01.16","T","Plant it and keep a diary.","book",52]]},{"id":"b02ca0a6-869b-0337-0707-c1030363e660","title":"Unit 4 Plant life (Wrap up & Check it & Let’s explore)","chapters":["Unit 4 Plant life","Wrap up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.11","P","Now I can name parts of a plant：","book",53],["EN-S1-LS-01.16","P","use \"-What are you planting？ -We're planting..\"","book",53],["EN-S1-TH-01.19","P","talk about the uses of plants.","book",53]]},{"id":"e2586ca4-939f-34e6-88f0-2767c6b6ab17","title":"Unit 4_Let’s explore_2 Listen and check.","chapters":["Unit 4 Plant life","Let's explore"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-CK-01.3","EN-S1-LS-01.12"],"align":[["EN-S1-CK-01.3","T","In the USA, the rose stands for love.","book",54],["EN-S1-LS-01.12","T","What's your favourite plant？","book",54]],"goals":{"take":"本课交待美国玫瑰象征含义和用句练习，能用简单句表达喜好与提问。","later":"更多国家/文化标志和复杂情感表达留后续课。","items":[["学生能在听录音和查看课文后，说出In the USA, the rose stands for love这句的含义，并能用中文或英语指出玫瑰的象征意义。",["EN-S1-CK-01.3"],"文化标志物和传统节日的简单信息","能复述该句并用一句话指出“玫瑰代表爱”。"],["学生能在两人一组的问答练习中，用What's your favourite plant?进行提问并用简单句（如I like… / I don't like…）回答，表达自己的喜好。",["EN-S1-LS-01.12"],"表达简单的情感和喜好","能正确发问并用一句完整句子说出自己喜欢或不喜欢的植物。"]]}},{"id":"4fd87e8b-8d79-1259-7aed-3b014b87e98e","title":"Unit 5_Words and expressions","chapters":["Unit 5 School activities"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.6","EN-S1-LS-01.9"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.6","T","Look and write. What are the school activities？","book",55],["EN-S1-LS-01.9","T","Listen and sing.","book",55]]},{"id":"e6479b50-2eff-8203-c29d-91f1a238eaac","title":"Unit 5 School activities (Get ready)","chapters":["Unit 5 School activities","Get ready"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.7"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.7","T","Learn the words","book",56]]},{"id":"d26afa7d-77ca-b11f-b1d5-06dd5ef0dc86","title":"Unit 5_Get ready_1 Listen and sing.","chapters":["Unit 5 School activities","Get ready"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LS-01.9"],"align":[["EN-S1-LS-01.9","T","Listen and sing.","title",null]]},{"id":"8620bc60-fe27-cfcc-f4be-0f9cbf0082b1","title":"Unit 5 School activities (Start up)","chapters":["Unit 5 School activities","Start up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.7"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.7","T","Learn the words","book",56]],"goals":{"take":"根据图片或录音提示，说出本课的单词和短语，能用正确音形读出。","later":"","items":[["学生能根据课件图片或教师示范的发音，说出并模仿本课的单词和短语，每个词至少连续正确朗读两遍。",["EN-S1-LK-01.7"],"说出单词和短语","能正确说出并连读本课词汇（如单词/短语），发音与示范相近。"]]}},{"id":"0c24a315-c69c-a43a-dfdb-8487d7ce3507","title":"Unit 5_Start up_1 Read and answer.","chapters":["Unit 5 School activities","Start up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LS-01.16","EN-S1-LK-01.11"],"align":[["EN-S1-LS-01.16","T","What is Daming doing？","book",57],["EN-S1-LK-01.11","T","Are you drawing,Daming？","book",57],["EN-S1-LS-01.3","P","There are horns on it.","book",57]],"goals":{"take":"用简单句根据图片描述人物动作并进行简短问答，能提取句中显性信息。","later":"","items":[["学生能根据课本图片用简单句回答“What is Daming doing?”并说出不少于一句描述性回答（如：He is drawing.）。",["EN-S1-LS-01.16"],"用简单的语句描述图片或事物","能用完整句说出Daming的动作，例如“He is drawing.”"],["学生能在师生对话情境中用所学句型完成问答（例如：Are you drawing, Daming? Yes, I am./No, I'm not.）。",["EN-S1-LK-01.11"],"在语境中运用所学语法知识描述人和物","能就画画与否进行正确的简短问答并给出肯/否回答。"],["学生能在听或看短文/图片时找到并朗读含有具体细节的句子，如课文中的'There are horns on it.'。",["EN-S1-LS-01.3"],"在听、读、看的过程中有目的地提取、梳理所需信息","能指出并朗读表示细节的一句话。"]]}},{"id":"00098376-ac64-df05-6b1b-485e8a256469","title":"Unit 5_Start up_3 Listen and choose.","chapters":["Unit 5 School activities","Start up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LS-01.3"],"align":[["EN-S1-LS-01.3","T","Are there any flowers？ No, there aren't","book",58],["EN-S1-TQ-02.1","P","Which is Lingling's painting？","book",58]],"goals":{"take":"听短对话/句子，提取关于有无、细节的信息，并能根据关键词从备选图中选出对应画作。","later":"","items":[["学生能听句子并判断物品的有无（如回答Are there any flowers?），能在听后选择正确答案并用短句回答。",["EN-S1-LS-01.3"],"在听、读、看的过程中有目的地提取、梳理所需信息","能在三项选择中选出正确选项并说出Yes/No简短回答。"],["学生能根据图片和关键词归纳出哪幅是Lingling的画，并能说出一条支持理由（如颜色或有无花朵）。",["EN-S1-TQ-02.1"],"归纳语篇的重要信息","能指出正确画作并用1–2句说明理由。"]]}},{"id":"994fe35c-2947-83d6-5f81-6e4cacf40290","title":"Unit 5 School activities (Speed up)","chapters":["Unit 5 School activities","Speed up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.11"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.11","T","There is a tree.","book",58],["EN-S1-LK-01.6","P","Talk about your art.","book",58],["EN-S1-LS-01.17","P","Work in pairs.","book",58]